Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: RamDll <ramdll7@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, curl, iptables, iproute2, ca-certificates, openssl, procps, util-linux, sudo, adwaita-icon-theme, policykit-1 | polkitd
Recommends: zenity
Homepage: https://github.com/RamDll/vless-tunnel
Description: Transparent VLESS tunnel for the whole system (Xray-core)
 vless-tunnel routes all TCP and UDP traffic (including QUIC/HTTP-3)
 through a VLESS server via Xray-core, using transparent TPROXY
 interception. Includes a native GTK4/libadwaita GUI, a menu shortcut,
 and a bundled Xray-core binary for offline installation.
